<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>RIT AcadeMIA</title>

<script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>

<style>
html{
scroll-behavior:smooth;
}
</style>

</head>


<body class="bg-white text-black">





<!-- HERO SECTION -->

<section id="home" class="py-28">

<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">

<h1 class="text-6xl font-bold leading-tight mb-8">
A Smarter Way To Organize <br>
Your Academic Journey
</h1>

<p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10">

RIT AcadeMIa is a student learning and academic resource platform
designed to simplify the way students access study materials,
organize subjects, and track their academic progress.

Instead of scattered notes, random YouTube playlists, and unstructured
study schedules, this platform brings everything into a single
organized academic ecosystem.

Students can access syllabus resources, structured unit-wise study
content, curated video lectures, previous year questions, and
a powerful progress tracking system that helps them stay
consistent and focused throughout their semester.

</p>

<a href="#auth"
class="bg-black text-white px-8 py-4 text-lg rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-800 transition">

Start Your Academic Journey

</a>

</div>

</section>



<!-- PROBLEM STATEMENT -->

<section class="bg-gray-50 py-24">

<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">

<h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-10">
The Problem Students Face
</h2>

<p class="text-lg text-gray-600 max-w-4xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">

Most students struggle to manage their academic resources efficiently.

Study materials are scattered across multiple platforms — notes in
one place, YouTube lectures in another, and previous year questions
somewhere else. This lack of structure makes studying inefficient,
time-consuming, and overwhelming.

Without a clear system to organize subjects, track completed topics,
and monitor progress, students often lose consistency in their studies.

RIT AcadeMIa solves this problem by providing a centralized
academic platform where everything related to a subject is
structured, accessible, and trackable.

</p>

</div>

</section>



<!-- FEATURES -->

<section id="features" class="py-24">

<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">

<h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-16">
What RIT AcadeMIa Provides
</h2>


<div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-12">


<div class="bg-black text-white p-10 rounded-xl shadow-xl hover:scale-105 transition">

<h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">
📚 Organized Subject Resources
</h3>

<p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">

All study resources are organized subject-wise and unit-wise,
making it easy for students to navigate through their syllabus
without wasting time searching for materials.

</p>

</div>



<div class="bg-black text-white p-10 rounded-xl shadow-xl hover:scale-105 transition">

<h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">
🎥 Curated Learning Content
</h3>

<p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">

Instead of random YouTube searches, students get curated
video lectures and learning materials that align with
their academic syllabus and topics.

</p>

</div>



<div class="bg-black text-white p-10 rounded-xl shadow-xl hover:scale-105 transition">

<h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">
📊 Progress Tracking System
</h3>

<p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">

Students can mark topics as completed and visually track
their academic progress, helping them stay consistent
throughout the semester.

</p>

</div>



<div class="bg-black text-white p-10 rounded-xl shadow-xl hover:scale-105 transition">

<h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">
📖 Unit-Wise Study Structure
</h3>

<p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">

Subjects are divided into units and topics so students
can follow a structured study flow instead of studying
randomly.

</p>

</div>



<div class="bg-black text-white p-10 rounded-xl shadow-xl hover:scale-105 transition">

<h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">
🎯 Topic Completion Tracking
</h3>

<p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">

Students can track exactly what they have studied and
what remains, making it easier to prepare efficiently
for exams.

</p>

</div>



<div class="bg-black text-white p-10 rounded-xl shadow-xl hover:scale-105 transition">

<h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">
⚡ Smart Academic Dashboard
</h3>

<p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">

A powerful dashboard gives students a complete overview
of their subjects, completed units, and learning progress
in one place.

</p>

</div>


</div>

</div>

</section>



<!-- HOW IT WORKS -->

<section id="workflow" class="bg-gray-50 py-24">

<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">

<h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-16">
How The Platform Works
</h2>


<div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-10">

<div>
<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">1. Create Account</h3>
<p class="text-gray-600">
Register and enter your academic details.
</p>
</div>

<div>
<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">2. Access Subjects</h3>
<p class="text-gray-600">
Explore subjects structured according to your semester.
</p>
</div>

<div>
<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">3. Study Resources</h3>
<p class="text-gray-600">
Learn using curated materials and video lectures.
</p>
</div>

<div>
<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">4. Track Progress</h3>
<p class="text-gray-600">
Mark completed topics and monitor your learning progress.
</p>
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>



<!-- AUTH SECTION -->

<section id="auth" class="py-24">

<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16">


<!-- REGISTER -->

<div class="bg-black text-white p-10 rounded-xl shadow-xl">

<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">
Create Your Account
</h2>

<p class="text-gray-300 mb-8">
Start organizing your academic journey and track your
learning progress efficiently.
</p>

<form action="/auth/register" method="POST" class="space-y-4">

<input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Full Name" required
class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-black">

<input type="text" name="branch" placeholder="Branch" required
class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-black">

<input type="number" name="year" placeholder="Year" required
class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-black">

<input type="number" name="semester" placeholder="Semester" required
class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-black">

<input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email" required
class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-black">

<input type="password" name="password" placeholder="Password" required
class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-black">

<input type="password" name="confirmPassword" placeholder="Confirm Password" required
class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg text-black">

<button
class="w-full bg-white text-black py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-gray-200 transition">

Create Account

</button>

</form>

</div>



<!-- LOGIN -->

<div class="bg-gray-100 p-10 rounded-xl shadow-xl">

<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">
Welcome Back
</h2>

<p class="text-gray-600 mb-8">
Log in to continue your learning journey and monitor
your academic progress.
</p>

<form action="/auth/login" method="POST" class="space-y-4">

<input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email" required
class="w-full border px-4 py-3 rounded-lg">

<input type="password" name="password" placeholder="Password" required
class="w-full border px-4 py-3 rounded-lg">

<button
class="w-full bg-black text-white py-3 rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-800 transition">

Login

</button>

</form>

</div>

</div>

</section>






</body>
</html>